Description: Academic research platform for monitoring Brazilian legislative data
    with comprehensive geographic analysis and AI-enhanced search capabilities.
    This version consolidates the multi-stack architecture into a pure R solution
    using modern frameworks like bslib, echarts4r, and leaflet.
